    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Superb Two Bedroom Second Floor Apartment in a Prime Residential Development\r\n\r\nRedmond Property are delighted to present No. 6 Cedar Place, a bright and spacious two-bedroom second floor apartment ideally located within the ever-popular Ridgewood development in Swords.\r\n\r\nThis well-maintained apartment offers generously proportioned accommodation throughout and is ideally suited to first-time buyers, downsizers and investors alike. The property benefits from a private balcony, gas fired central heating, double glazed uPVC windows and an impressive B2 BER, making it eligible for attractive green mortgage rates with many lenders.\r\n\r\nRidgewood is a mature and highly sought-after residential development offering an excellent range of amenities on its doorstep. Residents enjoy easy access to neighbourhood shops, cafés, supermarkets, schools, parks and sports clubs, while the Pavilions Shopping Centre, Airside Retail Park and Swords Village are all just a short drive away. Dublin Airport, the M1, M50 and a frequent Dublin Bus service and Swords Express provide excellent connectivity to Dublin City Centre and beyond.\r\n\r\nACCOMNMODATION (Please refer to floor plan for room measurements)\r\n\r\nEntrance hall with hot press\r\nBedroom (1) with built-in wardrobes\r\nBedroom (2) with built-in wardrobes\r\nBathroom fully tiled with w.c., w.h.b., bath\r\nLarge living / dining room with storage press and access to balcony\r\nKitchen with fully fitted wall/floor units, kitchen appliances\r\n\r\nFEATURES\r\n\r\nSpacious second floor apartment\r\nTwo generous bedrooms\r\nPrivate balcony off the living room\r\nSeparate kitchen\r\nGas fired central heating\r\nDouble glazed uPVC windows\r\nImpressive B2 Energy Rating\r\nAmple communal car parking\r\nWell-maintained communal areas\r\nMature and established residential development\r\nExcellent transport links including Dublin Bus, M1, M50 and Dublin Airport\r\nIdeal first-time buyer, investment or downsizer opportunity\r\nAnnual Service Charge €2,245.36 per annum\r\n\r\nVIEWING \r\nBy appointment with Redmond Property (Swords)\r\nContact Alan Redmond FIPAV TRV"
      },
